      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       NORMALISE-PREMIUM-0127.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
               STRING WS-KEY-CUSTOMER DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         '/'              DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         WS-KEY-POLICY    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         INTO WS-KEY-CHAR
               END-STRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       EXPAND-AGENT-CODE-0128.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
               STRING WS-KEY-CUSTOMER DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         '/'              DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         WS-KEY-POLICY    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         INTO WS-KEY-CHAR
               END-STRING.
